fic rules and locked algorithmic decisions. Treat those files as authoritative\nfor anything inside that package."},"437":{"id":"/mn/docs/dev/workspace-30","page_id":"/mn/docs/dev/workspace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/mn/docs/dev/workspace#type-generation-ts-rs","content":"Domain models that cross the IPC boundary derive `ts_rs::TS` and export TypeScript\ninterfaces into `src/lib/types/generated/` when `cargo test -p shalgalt-core` runs. The\nfrontend script `pnpm generate-types` wraps the same command. A drift between the Rust struct\nand the generated TS fails `pnpm check` in CI — this is the mechanical enforcement of\nRule 3."},"438":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","type":"page","content":"Жишээ файлууд","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Хэрэглэгчийн гарын авлага","Жишээ","Жишээ файлууд"],"tags":[],"url":"/mn/docs/user/samples"},"439":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-0","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/mn/docs/user/samples","content":"Бэлэн .shalgalt жишээ төслүүд — нээлттэй, шифрлэсэн, PDF-тэй."},"440":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-1","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/mn/docs/user/samples#жишээ-shalgalt-файлууд","content":"Жишээ `.shalgalt` файлууд"},"441":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-2","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/mn/docs/user/samples#татаж-авах","content":"Татаж авах"},"442":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-3","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/mn/docs/user/samples#бүтэц","content":"Бүтэц"},"443":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-4","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/mn/docs/user/samples#дахин-үүсгэх","content":"Дахин үүсгэх"},"444":{"id":"/mn/docs/user/samples-5","page_id":"/mn/docs/user/samples","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/mn/docs/user/samples#жишээ-shalgalt-файлууд","content":"Програмыг туршихад зориулсан **гурван бэлэн жишээ төсөл**. Эдгээр нь зөвхөн жишээ бөгөөд\n**